<title>INDIA: TEXT - India finalises bids for oil/gas exploration.</title>
<headline>TEXT - India finalises bids for oil/gas exploration.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the firms which have won the right to explore for oil and gas as announced by the Indian government on Thursday.</p>
<p>Under the seventh round of bidding, a total of 12 bids for 10 blocks (of the 45 blocks offered) were received, the government said. Seven bids were accepted.</p>
<p>In the eighth round of bidding, a total of 33 bids were received for 18 blocks. Seven bids were accepted.</p>
<p>Two bids were accepted for small-scale oilfields, in the first round of offers. In the second round, bids for nine fields were awarded.</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    BLOCK NO		 AWARDED TO (SEVENTH ROUND)</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>1)  CB-ON/1	  Rexwood Corporation-Oakland Oil Company,</p>
<p>			 U.S.A.</p>
<p>2)  CB-OM/3	  Essar Oil Ltd</p>
<p>3)  CB-ON/4	  Opeseis Inc, U.S.A.</p>
<p>4)  CB-ON/5	  Opeseis Inc, U.S.A.</p>
<p>5)  AA-ON/3	  Rexwood Corporation-Oakland Oil Company,</p>
<p>			 U.S.A.</p>
<p>6)  GK-ON/4	  Phoenix Overseas Ltd, New Delhi</p>
<p>7)  SR-OS-94/1     Reliance Industries Ltd, Bombay</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    BLOCK NO		 AWARDED TO (EIGHTH ROUND)</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------- 1)  AA-ON/4 &amp;		Occidental International Exploration</p>
<p>				 and Production Company, U.S.A</p>
<p>2)  AA-ON/6		  Occidental International Exploration</p>
<p>				 and Production Company, U.S.A</p>
<p>3)  AAP-ON-94/1	    Hindustan Oil Exploration Company-</p>
<p>				 General Fibres (P) Ltd</p>
<p>4)  AA-ON/7		  The Assam Company Ltd and Medallion</p>
<p>				 Company, U.S.A.</p>
<p>5)  CR-ON-90/1	     Essar-HOEC</p>
<p>6)  BB-OS/8		  Reliance Industries Ltd, Enron</p>
<p>				 Exploration Company, U.S.A.</p>
<p>7)  KG-ON/1		  Larsen and Toubro, Tullow Oil Plc and</p>
<p>				 Joshi Technologies Inc</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    FIELD		    AWARDED TO (FIRST OFFER)</p>
<p>--------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>1)  Kargisan		 Selan Exploration Technologies Ltd.</p>
<p>(oil field)</p>
<p>2)  Modhera		  Interlink Petroleum Ltd, Baroda</p>
